      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2001 S. Karger AG, Basel",
        "AbstractText": "Mesenteric volvulus is a potentially life-threatening condition. Little information is available for the recommended treatment of viable bowel and virtually no information is available for the suggested elective treatment of a mesenteric volvulus. This communication details a series of enteropexies that were successful in the management of this disorder."
